    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "Why is my tulsi plant drying out and drooping in the heat?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "A tulsi that droops and gets dry, crisp leaves in summer is usually short of water. In the UAE heat, a small pot in full sun can dry out completely between waterings, and the roots cannot keep up."
